source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Check source-data availability for a window and trigger top-up imports for missing ranges

Usage: vendo destinations refresh-source [OPTIONS] <destinationId>

Arguments:
  <destinationId>  

Options:
      --from <date>  Window start — ISO datetime or YYYY-MM-DD (default: 7 days before --to)
      --to <date>    Window end — ISO datetime or YYYY-MM-DD (default: now)
      --json         Output raw JSON
  -h, --help         Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo destinations refresh-source <destinationId>
  $ vendo destinations refresh-source <destinationId> --from 2026-06-29 --to 2026-07-02
  $ vendo destinations refresh-source <destinationId> --json
